  "description": "A blood mage has taken a Seattle tenement. Clear the building and eliminate the mage to claim his grimoire.",
  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "briefing": "Haruki Sato \u2014 blood mage, ex-Renraku, off the deep end. Holed up in a tenement on the outskirts of the Redmond Barrens. Word is he's running blood rituals to crack open a Matrix gate to a deep node. He's got hired guns on the lower floors and his ritual chamber's warded to hell. Get in, kill the mage, take whatever's on him, and torch the place on your way out.",
